    "body": "Cache population started running AWS H100 image builds on GPU runners after #8102 removed the maintainer CPU override. These builds fail during ECR login with `error storing credentials ... not implemented`, preventing scheduled Testmon baseline refreshes. Example: https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/actions/runs/38616202277/job/116032036408.\n\nRestore `nvidia-ci-aws-cpu` for maintainer AWS H100 image builds. Keep the exported `matrix.runner` unchanged so Testmon baseline jobs continue using GPU runners. GCP builds, GB200 builds, and external contributor runner routing retain their existing behavior.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Existing `tests/test_utils/test_testmon_workflow.py`: 81 passed.\n- `actionlint -shellcheck= -pyflakes= .github/workflows/_build_ci_container.yml`: passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- Repository autoformat check: passed; no Python files changed.\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
